      "title": "List mailboxes",
      "description": "Preferred mailbox discovery step for the authenticated workspace. Call this before create_mailbox for any workflow that needs an email identity, including signup, receipt, or verification flows. Reuse only a mailbox dedicated to the same account/purpose with can_receive=true, receiving_status=ready, and disabled_at=null; ask when multiple candidates remain. welcome_onboarding_status tracks welcome/demo artifacts, not inbound readiness. Each result includes public_id for mailboxId path parameters, workspace_id, email for external forms and From addresses, and name. Do not create a duplicate mailbox on retries.",
